;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"98\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"CharlotteProfile.jpg\" data-image-key=\"CharlotteProfile.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/7/7f/CharlotteProfile.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20150614070852\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/7/7f/CharlotteProfile.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150614070852\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Info on Charlotte.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/7/7f/CharlotteProfile.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20150614070852\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"98\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"CharlotteProfile.jpg\" data-image-key=\"CharlotteProfile.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/7/7f/CharlotteProfile.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20150614070852\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:CharlotteProfile.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Info on Charlotte.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p><b>Charlotte</b> is a madam who regularly stops by <a href=\"/wiki/Pio\" title=\"Pio\">Pio</a>'s shop.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Character\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Character</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Quest\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quest</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Challenge_Quest\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Challenge Quest</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Dialogues\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogues</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Character\">Character</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FCharlotte%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>She seems to be in high class and gives off the impression that she is wealthy. When speaking, she refers to herself in third person.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quest\">Quest</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FCharlotte%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Challenge_Quest\">Challenge Quest</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FCharlotte%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Charlotte will always request one potion of MAX level. When the quest is completed, 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Likeability\" title=\"Likeability\">likeability</a> points are rewarded to the current character.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogues\">Dialogues</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FCharlotte%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>See <a href=\"/wiki/Charlotte/dialogues\" title=\"Charlotte/dialogues\">Charlotte's dialogues</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FCharlotte%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"46a19233c22fe73a9b0bef9d250eafae\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:175px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"CharlottePortraitHappy-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:173px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:CharlottePortraitHappy.png\" title=\"CharlottePortraitHappy.png (99 KB)\" style=\"height:173px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/5/5c/CharlottePortraitHappy.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20150613163050\" title=\"CharlottePortr